{
  "_comment": "PROVISIONAL SCAFFOLDING (committed 2026-07-19). Sanitized template of the gitignored .mcp.json, committed so the README's MCP references resolve in a public clone. To use: copy to .mcp.json (which stays gitignored) and replace <YOUR_CLUSTER_ID> with your CockroachDB Cloud cluster id (Cloud console -> cluster -> Connect). The MCP endpoint authenticates via OAuth in-session; there is NO token or secret to store here. R1 (a later session) will actually exercise this MCP server and may revise this template, so treat it as honest-but-provisional until then. JSON has no comment syntax; if a strict parser rejects this file after you copy it, delete this _comment key.",
  "mcpServers": {
    "cockroachdb-cloud": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://cockroachlabs.cloud/mcp",
      "headers": {
        "mcp-cluster-id": "<YOUR_CLUSTER_ID>"
      }
    }
  }
}
